      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/worked-solution": "The rate of change is proportional to the difference between the maximum capacity and the current quantity. Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}N}{\\text{d}t}=k(a-N),\n$$\n\nwhere $a$ is the maximum capacity and $k>0$.\n\nHere $a=376$, so\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}N}{\\text{d}t}=k(376-N).\n$$"
    },
